  "contentHtml": "<p>과학도서를 구입하려구요.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>양장본(사이즈가 크고)이고,</p><p>그림이 풍부한 과학도서 추천해주세요.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>일단 제가 추천할 도서는&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>1. 인체 완전판(2판) - 사이언스북스</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c0af3e8ae03b854a9dc4ca52beaf8974562914e7\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"200\" height=\"233\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c0af3e8ae03b854a9dc4ca52beaf8974562914e7\" data-origin-width=\"413\" data-origin-height=\"482\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>2. 빅 히스토리 - 사이언스북스</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ef38de2aad58516ac82dd7f6fccb44630d16e783\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"200\" height=\"237\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ef38de2aad58516ac82dd7f6fccb44630d16e783\" data-origin-width=\"410\" data-origin-height=\"486\"></div><p>3.&#160; 도구와 기계의 원리&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f87e5f73f3b6c257d4e7c8e365e3021103c91268\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"200\" height=\"254\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f87e5f73f3b6c257d4e7c8e365e3021103c91268\" data-origin-width=\"295\" data-origin-height=\"375\"></div><p>4. 뉴턴 하이라이트</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0209bcaa3dd5146507d3ece7e866c1eecf09299e\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"200\" height=\"266\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0209bcaa3dd5146507d3ece7e866c1eecf09299e\" data-origin-width=\"296\" data-origin-height=\"393\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
